{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01RTHqyk47ucjiG4PjbAeynn", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://parental-control.flashget.com/th/how-can-parents-understand-teen-slang-without-spying\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.marketingoops.com/?p=78490\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.blockdit.com/posts/6537ba0aef7d04ae31d5a3a3\"}, {\"url\": \"https://creatrip.com/th/news/7497\"}, {\"url\": \"https://creatrip.com/th/blog/7497\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.marketingoops.com/campaigns/speak-emoji-to-understand-this-anti-drug-campaign\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.ksat.com/news/local/2020/10/02/the-big-coverup-teens-speaking-in-code\"}, {\"url\": \"https://files.eric.ed.gov/fulltext/EJ1312742.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://parental-control.flashget.com/th/sexual-slang-2025\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T23:16:18.480Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "ป้ายยา แปลว่า ศัพท์วัยรุ่น", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01EgHjQRwp4LtjKfLJoZVgEb", "content": [{"title": "FlashGet ส์ FlashGet ส์", "url": "https://parental-control.flashget.com/th/how-can-parents-understand-teen-slang-without-spying"}, {"title": "แคมเปญต่อต้านยาเสพติด ใช้ “Emoji” สื่อสาร หวังเข้าถึงกลุ่มวัยรุ่น", "url": "https://www.marketingoops.com/?p=78490"}, {"title": "Blockdit Logo", "url": "https://www.blockdit.com/posts/6537ba0aef7d04ae31d5a3a3"}, {"title": "creatrip.com", "url": "https://creatrip.com/th/news/7497"}, {"title": "creatrip.com", "url": "https://creatrip.com/th/blog/7497"}, {"title": "แคมเปญต่อต้านยาเสพติด ใช้ “Emoji” สื่อสาร หวังเข้าถึงกลุ่มวัยรุ่น", "url": "https://www.marketingoops.com/campaigns/speak-emoji-to-understand-this-anti-drug-campaign"}, {"title": "the big coverup teens speaking in code", "url": "https://www.ksat.com/news/local/2020/10/02/the-big-coverup-teens-speaking-in-code"}, {"title": "files.eric.ed.gov", "url": "https://files.eric.ed.gov/fulltext/EJ1312742.pdf"}, {"title": "FlashGet Kids FlashGet Kids", "url": "https://parental-control.flashget.com/th/sexual-slang-2025"}]}, "The search did not return a source that defines \"ป้ายยา.\" None of the results mention the term, so I can't confirm its meaning from these results.\n\nThe results were about teen slang in general, including:\n- Teen slang abbreviations and phrases, which parents might use to hide meaning from others (FlashGet, index 9-1).\n- Drug slang used by teens in Algeria and the U.S. (index 8-6, index 7-7).\n- Korean youth slang (creatrip, index 4-1).\n\nIf the requesting model needs the Thai meaning, it should search again with a different phrasing, such as \"ป้ายยา ความหมาย\" or \"ป้ายยา อินฟลูเอนเซอร์.\" From general knowledge only, not these results, \"ป้ายยา\" is commonly used in Thai online slang to mean aggressively recommending or promoting a product, often by influencers. Treat that as unverified until a source confirms it."], "durationSeconds": 4.698231167, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01RTHqyk47ucjiG4PjbAeynn", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
